        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westwood_(Knoxville%2C_Tennessee)",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 5,000‑square‑foot house boasts ten fireplaces, each with custom mantels and decorative tiles.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westwood_(Knoxville%2C_Tennessee)"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Westwood earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 1984 for its distinctive architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westwood_(Knoxville%2C_Tennessee)",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2012 the Aslan Foundation purchased Westwood, intending to restore it and transfer it to Knox Heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westwood_(Knoxville%2C_Tennessee)"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Guided tours of Historic Westwood run hourly on Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Fridays, with events and donations available.",
